1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,900
M: I've just heard on the radio that all flights from the domestic air terminal will be delayed by two hours.

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,935
There's been a security alert and they're searching all the bags.

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,280
W: Oh, no!

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,800
That's going to cause us a serious problem.

5
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:18,140
Our clients are expecting us and we won't be able to make it for the meeting.

6
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,880
M: That shouldn't be a big problem.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,060
I am expecting a call from them this afternoon to talk about the seminar.

8
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:27,520
I'll see if I can postpone the meeting until tomorrow morning.
